{"sourceUrl":"https://laws.lzu.edu.cn/tongzhigonggao/2026/0616/333200.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:30.439009+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://laws.lzu.edu.cn/tongzhigonggao/2026/0616/333200.html","html":"<div>\n<h3>兰州大学法学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动通知</h3>\n<div>【来源：法学院   |  发布日期：2026-06-16  】</div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>为增进大学生</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>对法学学科的进一步了解，培养对法学研究的浓厚兴趣，搭建高校大学生之间的交流平台，吸引有培养潜质的优秀大学生继续深造，特举办</span><span>“</span><span>兰州大学法学院</span><span>202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年全国优秀大</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学生夏令营</span><span>”</span><span>活动。现就有关事项通知如下：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span>一、活动时间</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>：</span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>中旬</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>（具体时间和形式另行通知）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span>二、活动名额</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>40</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>人</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span>三、招生学科</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>：法学、法律（法学）、法律（非法学）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span>四、申请条件</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>1. <span>具有良好的政治素质和思想道德素养，政治立场坚定，德、智、体</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>、美、劳</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>全面发展，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>2. <span>就读于具有推免资格的</span><span>202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>届本科毕业生，优先接收高水平大学和优势特色学科专业的同学；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>3. <span>在校前</span><span>5</span><span>学期学业成绩排名占所在专业或班级前</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>0%<span>，且所有专业课成绩均须及格；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>4. <span>英语水平良好，至少达到大学英语六级水平或相当能力；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>5. <span>无任何学术不端行为及违法违纪等受处分记录。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span>五、申请流程</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>1. <span>电子材料提交</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）材料目录清单（附件</span><span>3</span><span>）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）兰州大学法学院全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表（见附表</span>1<span>）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）两封专家亲笔签名推荐信（见附表</span>2<span>）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）本科前</span>5<span>个学期成绩单（由教务部门盖章），排名专业或班级前</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>0<span>％的证明（由教务部门或院系盖章）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）身份证、学生证复印件；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）英语六级证书或其他英语水平证明材料；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>其他证明</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>材料（如获奖证书、学术论文、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>TOEFL/IELTS/GRE/GMAT</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>成绩单等复印件，非必须）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>请将上述申请材料扫描件按顺序排列打包</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>为一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>扫描件</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>于</span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span>18:00<span>前</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>发送至</span><span>fxyyjs@lzu.edu.cn</span><span>，并通过问卷星完成报名登记，链接如下：</span><span>https://v.wjx.cn/vm/YRrEZqS.aspx# </span><span>。</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>附件命名格式为：</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>姓名</span><span>—</span></strong></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><strong>XX<span>大学</span></strong></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>—</span></strong></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><strong>XX<span>专业</span></strong></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>—</span></strong></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>申请学科</span></strong></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>【</span></strong></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>法学</span>/<span>法律（法学）</span><span>/</span><span>法律（非法学）三选一</span></strong></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>】</span></strong></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>. <span>纸质材料提交</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>申请人通过营员资格审核后，入营报到时提交夏令营报名表、成绩单原件和其他要求的纸质材料。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>注：电子材料、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>报名登记、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>纸质材料提交缺一不可。材料须真实有效，因信息填写错误、填报虚假信息造成的后果由申请人本人承担。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span>六、选拔考核</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>1. <span>营员选拔</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>学院将组织专家逐一审核评估申请者提供的各项材料，择优确定夏令营参营名单，审核通过的夏令营参营名单将在学院官方网站公布。未通过资格审核的申请人皆为未入选者，将不再另行通知，如有放弃入营资格者</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，学院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>将根据材料审核情况依次递补。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>七、活动总体内容</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>1. <span>开营典礼</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>2. <span>讲座与交流</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span> <span><span><span><span>实践与考察</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>参观走访</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>甘肃省博物馆、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>校史馆、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学院展览馆</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>等</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li><span><span><span><span><span><span>对营员进行综合</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>考察</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>，确定优秀营员名单</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span><span><span><span><span><span>具体活动安排另行通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>八、注意事项</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span> <span><span><span><span>参加夏令营的学员须严格遵守学院相关管理规定，严格按照日程安排进行学习和活动；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span> <span><span><span><span>为营员提供夏令营期间的食宿（双人标间，原则上双人入住，本地学校营员不提供住宿）、人身保险费。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span> <span><span><span><span>交通费报销说明：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>根据教育部系统报名情况</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>实报实销，往返报销上限</span>800<span>元，限乘高铁二等座火车硬卧、汽车、飞机经济舱，须有原始票据，请自行安排往返交通，主办方不提供订票服务。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>九</span></strong></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span><strong><span>、联系方式</span></strong></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span> <span><span><span><span>咨询电话：</span>0931-8915653</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span> <span><span><span><span>联系人：宋老师</span>  </span></span></span><span><span><span><span>联系部门：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>研究生教育教学办公室</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span> <span><span><span><span>咨询时间：工作日上午</span>8:30-12:00<span>，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>14:</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>30-18:00</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://laws.lzu.edu.cn/laws/upload/files/20260616/c4bc1ff4a815405c9ebc1424a10278d2.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span><span>附件1.兰州大学法学院全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表</span></span></span></span></span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://laws.lzu.edu.cn/laws/upload/files/20260616/48726aebec814793b80d34505315126a.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span><span>附件2.专家推荐信（模板）</span></span></span></span></span></a></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://laws.lzu.edu.cn/laws/upload/files/20260616/8a078f45422d4623afada85f6f034abc.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3.兰州大学法学院夏令营申请材料列表</a></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div></div>\n<div></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"4e4be4f9d7ac6e70b953bac431bc4af5f12938112beff7920997c6ae05d96063","textLength":1428,"sourceSha256":"6ce8b40698b2108d89dbb3da2575a28cde023a0d7d651c6cb4b4e65f9f868a9d","selector":"article-like:article","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a0f221db48b2c925832c","title":"2026年兰州大学法学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:30.439009+00:00"}
